OL,3,AMan who stabbed ex in 'rage of anger'
OL,4,Aas she walked her dog jailed for 24
OL,5,Ayears
OL,6,
OL,7,FA man who repeatedly stabbed his
OL,8,Fex-partner in the chest and then fled,
OL,9,Flaunching a four-day manhunt, has been
OL,10,Fjailed for 24 years.
OL,12,FJoanne Sidaway, 49, screamed as she was
OL,13,Fattacked by James McKenna, 58, in the
OL,14,Fbushes of Carmarthen Park in January.
OL,16,FHe then hid in a wood near Carmarthen
OL,17,Ffor three days without food and water,
OL,18,Fbefore being arrested in hospital while
OL,19,Fhe was being treated for frostbite.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
